                    <div id=3D"faq-content" class=3D"main-content">
                        <div>
                            <p>Create MyASUS in WinRE For USB</p>
                            <p>&nbsp;</p><p><a id=3D"z"><span style=3D"colo=
r:hsl(0,0%,0%);"><span><strong>Table of Contents</strong></span></span></a>=
</p><p><a href=3D"https://www.asus.com/support/faq/1051464/#a1"><strong>Abo=
ut MyASUS in WinRE For USB</strong></a></p><p><a href=3D"https://www.asus.c=
om/support/faq/1051464/#a2"><strong>Hardware Requirements</strong></a></p><=
p><a href=3D"https://www.asus.com/support/faq/1051464/#a3"><strong>Download=
 the Toolkit</strong></a></p><p><a href=3D"https://www.asus.com/support/faq=
/1051464/#a4"><strong>Create MyASUS in WinRE For USB tool</strong></a></p><=
p><a href=3D"https://www.asus.com/support/faq/1051464/#a5"><strong>Perform =
System Diagnostics via MyASUS in WinRE for USB</strong></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p=
><p><a id=3D"a1"><span style=3D"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);"><span><strong>About to=
ol MyASUS in WinRE For USB</strong></span></span></a></p><p>This tool creat=
es a bootable USB drive to enable the system to boot into MyASUS in WinRe E=
nvironment.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a id=3D"a2"><span style=3D"color:hsl(0,0%,0=
%);"><span><strong>Hardware Requirements</strong></span></span></a></p><p>U=
SB Flash Drive (Capacity suggestion is higher than 2GB and with <a href=3D"=
https://www.asus.com/support/FAQ/1044735" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener=
 noreferrer">FAT32 format</a>).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a id=3D"a3"><span style=
=3D"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);"><span><strong>Download the Toolkit</strong></span>=
</span></a></p><p>How to get MyASUS in WinRE For USB toolkit, please refer =
to ASUS official website [<a href=3D"https://www.asus.com/support/FAQ/10353=
76" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer">How to search and downloa=
d Drivers, Utilities, BIOS, and User Manuals</a>].</p><p>*The product must =
support the Cloud Recovery feature (<a href=3D"https://www.asus.com/support=
/cloud-recovery/" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer">Check if yo=
ur product supports Cloud Recovery</a>) to use this tool.</p><p><span>*If y=
ou do not find the Toolkit in the product download center, it means that th=
is product model does not support temporarily.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i=
mg class=3D"image_resized" style=3D"width:800px;" src=3D"https://km-ap.asus=
.com/uploads/PhotoLibrarys/a2c99d98-3e16-483d-8d8d-064ecb2d7f6c/20231123174=
029465_EN08b.png"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>After toolkit downloaded, please put =
the file into your This PC or USB Drive.</p><p><img class=3D"image_resized"=
 style=3D"width:800px;" src=3D"https://km-ap.asus.com/uploads/PhotoLibrarys=
/a2c99d98-3e16-483d-8d8d-064ecb2d7f6c/20231123174148641_EN0.png"></p><p><a =
href=3D"https://www.asus.com/support/faq/1051464/#z">[Back to Content]</a><=
/p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a id=3D"a4"><span style=3D"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);"><span><=
strong>Create MyASUS in WinRE For USB tool</strong></span></span></a></p><p=
>Please executing the toolkit (EXE file) with mouse left-click twice.</p><p=
><img class=3D"image_resized" style=3D"width:800px;" src=3D"https://km-ap.a=
sus.com/uploads/PhotoLibrarys/a2c99d98-3e16-483d-8d8d-064ecb2d7f6c/20231123=
174148641_EN0.png"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Select the language to use during th=
e installation, then click [OK] to start.</p><p><img class=3D"image_resized=
" style=3D"width:400px;" src=3D"https://km-ap.asus.com/uploads/PhotoLibrary=
s/a2c99d98-3e16-483d-8d8d-064ecb2d7f6c/20231123174318029_EN01.png"></p><p>&=
nbsp;</p><p>Click [Next] to continue MyASUS in WinRE for USB tool installat=
ion.</p><p><img class=3D"image_resized" style=3D"width:600px;" src=3D"https=
://km-ap.asus.com/uploads/PhotoLibrarys/a2c99d98-3e16-483d-8d8d-064ecb2d7f6=
c/20231123174615124_EN02b.png"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Please read the followin=
g License Agreement. You must accept the terms of this agreement before con=
tinuing with the installation.</p><p><img class=3D"image_resized" style=3D"=
width:600px;" src=3D"https://km-ap.asus.com/uploads/PhotoLibrarys/a2c99d98-=
3e16-483d-8d8d-064ecb2d7f6c/20231123174749880_EN3b.png"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p=
>Confirm destination location and then click [Next] to continue.</p><p><img=
 class=3D"image_resized" style=3D"width:600px;" src=3D"https://km-ap.asus.c=
om/uploads/PhotoLibrarys/a2c99d98-3e16-483d-8d8d-064ecb2d7f6c/2023112317492=
4522_EN04b.png"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Click [Install] to continue with MyASUS=
 in WinRE For USB tool installation.</p><p><img class=3D"image_resized" sty=
le=3D"width:600px;" src=3D"https://km-ap.asus.com/uploads/PhotoLibrarys/a2c=
99d98-3e16-483d-8d8d-064ecb2d7f6c/20231123175113674_EN05b.png"></p><p>&nbsp=
;</p><p>The toolkit will run automatically to completed, then click [Finish=
] to exit setup.</p><p><img class=3D"image_resized" style=3D"width:600px;" =
src=3D"https://km-ap.asus.com/uploads/PhotoLibrarys/a2c99d98-3e16-483d-8d8d=
-064ecb2d7f6c/20231123175240719_EN06b.png"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a id=3D"a5"=
><span style=3D"color:hsl(0,0%,0%);"><span><strong>Perform System Diagnosti=
cs via MyASUS in WinRE for USB</strong></span></span></a></p><p>Please inse=
rt the USB flash drive with the tool installed into your laptop and use [<a=
 href=3D"https://www.asus.com/support/FAQ/1013017/" target=3D"_blank" rel=
=3D"noopener noreferrer">Boot the system from USB flash drive</a>] through =
the boot menu. After booting through the USB flash drive, the computer will=
 enter System Diagnostics within MyASUS in WinRE. Please refer to [<a href=
=3D"https://www.asus.com/support/FAQ/1043576" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noop=
ener noreferrer">System Diagnostics within MyASUS in WinRE - Introduction</=
a>] to complete the Diagnostics.&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=3D=
"https://www.asus.com/support/faq/1051464/#z">[Back to Content]</a></p>
                        </div>
